h3 "Navbar burger #" @17,7188,694,19
text The navbar-burger is a hamburger menu that only appears on touch devices. It has to appear as the last child of navbar-brand. It has to contain four empty span tags in order to visualize the hamburger lines or the cross (when active). @17,7219,694,61
